Subject: [PATCH] Cross-check VM core against independent Python corpus

Review integration note (2026-10-14; newly recorded explanation):
Add a standalone native runner and deterministic Python/reference comparisons for execution and malformed scripts. Passing this corpus establishes agreement for the covered subset, not complete P03 conformance.

